 in Ano are treated in this hospital. Well established herbal gardens are available for teaching & training. Most of these facilities are \r\n\r\noffered free of cost sponsored by Govt. Of India & Govt. Of Gujarat. <br><br><br><br>\r\n                                </p>\r\n--\n\r\n\t\t <div class=\"col-md-3\" style=\"border:#FF0000 2px solid;\">\r\n\t\t <img src=\"img/sideicon/academic.png\" style=\"border:none; border:#FF0000 2px solid;\">\r\n\t\t <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; border:#FF0000 2px solid; margin-top:0px;\">About University</h3>\r\n\t\t </div> \r\n\r\n\t\t <div class=\"col-md-3\" style=\"border:#FF0000 2px solid;\">\r\n--\n                          <img src=\"img/sideicon/university.png\" style=\"border:none\">                        </a>  \r\n                        <a href=\"university.php\" style=\"color:#FFF\">\r\n\r\n                          <h3 style=\"font-size:18px;\">About University</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n--\n                <div class=\"container u-PaddingTop50 u-PaddingBottom50\">\r\n                    <div class=\"Blurb Blurb--wrapper60 Blurb--transparent text-white u-xs-PaddingLeft0 u-xs-PaddingRight0\">\r\n                        <h2 class=\"u-MarginTop0 u-MarginBottom10\">Vision</h2>\r\n                        <p class=\"u-LineHeight2 text-white\">To be an Institution par excellence for the Science of Ayurveda and AlliedSciences in teaching, training, \r\n\r\ntreatment, research, extension, global promotion and propagation.\r\n<!--<div class=\"boxheight\"></div>\t-->\t\t\t\t\t\r\n--\n                    <div class=\"Blurb__hoverBg Blurb__hoverBg--gradient Thumb Thumb--92px Thumb--black u-Rounded\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fa fa-university Icon--32px\" style=\"margin-top:30px;\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <a href=\"about_university.php\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><h3 class=\"Blurb__hoverText\">About University</h